== stdout (1317 bytes)
Kluris — Turn AI agents into team subject matter experts.

Usage: kluris [OPTIONS] COMMAND [ARGS]...

Commands:
  create          Create a new brain.
  register        Register an existing brain directory on disk.
  list            List registered brains.
  wake-up         Compact brain snapshot for agent session bootstrap.
  search          Search a brain's neurons, glossary, and brain.md for a query string.
  status          Show brain status and recent changes.
  companion       Manage embedded companion playbooks per brain.
  dream           Brain maintenance — regenerate maps, update dates, auto-fix safe issues, validate remaining links.
  mri             Generate interactive brain visualization.
  remove          Unregister a brain (does not delete files).
  doctor          Check prerequisites and refresh installed agent skills.
  commit          Commit approved brain files and the maps they change.
  sync            Fetch, merge and push brains with their remotes.
  resolve         Settle an open sync conflict path by path.
  self-update     Update kluris to the newest release.
  self-uninstall  Remove the installed kluris.
  help            Show help for kluris commands.

Options:
      --version
          Show the version and exit.

      --help
          Show this message and exit.
